description	"Czerka Overseer

2 Life Corpo Supervisor with various prototype weaponry. 

^2Base Weaponry:
- Melee
- Pulse Grenades (2)
- Shock Baton (Red Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Defense
-- No Blaster Deflect
-- 2 Hit Combo, 70 Damage
-- Stuns

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (1)
- Assemble (1)
- Dodge (1)
- Medpack ^3[CS3]
- Ammo (3)

^8Abilites:
- Dodge (1) ^3[CS1]"
